            </note>
            <note corresp="#d330-f4" n="4" xml:id="d330-f4-content">
                <p>A completed draft policy paper on Antarctica was submitted to Deputy Under
                    Secretary Murphy on May 20, by Bowie. (Department of State, S/P–NSC Files: Lot
                    62 D 1, Antarctica—NSC 5715)</p>
            </note>
